        <select 
          id="targetSelect" 
          class="w-full bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-xs md:text-sm text-ink focus:ring-2 focus:ring-sky-500 font-medium"
        >
          {hpcdData.microbialTargets.map((tar) => (
            <option value={tar.id} selected={tar.id === 'ecoli_o157h7'}>
              {tar.organism}
            </option>
          ))}
        </select>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1 leading-normal" id="targetDescriptionText">
          {d.targetHelp}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Real-Time Diagnostic Dashboard -->
  <div class="mb-10">
    <div class="mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>🔬</span>
        <span>{d.diagnosticTitle}</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-muted mt-1">
        {d.diagnosticSub}
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Status Hero Card -->
    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border mb-6 transition-all" id="statusHeroCard">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted mb-1">
            {d.safetyStatusLabel}
          </div>
          <div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold flex items-center gap-2" id="safetyStatusText">
            <span id="safetyStatusIcon">✅</span>
            <span id="safetyStatusTitle">Optimal Supercritical CO2 Sterilization</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase border" id="complianceBadge">
          FDA 21 CFR § 120 COMPLIANT (≥ 5.0 LOG)
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-hairline/60 pt-4 text-xs">
        <div>
          <span class="font-bold text-muted block mb-0.5">{d.primaryRiskLabel}</span>
          <span class="font-medium text-ink" id="primaryRiskText">Adequate mass transfer; no limiting bottlenecks detected.</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="font-bold text-muted block mb-0.5">{d.mechanismsLabel}</span>
          <span class="font-medium text-ink" id="mechanismsText">Dense-phase phospholipid extraction &amp; cytoplasmic pH collapse.</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="font-bold text-muted block mb-0.5">{d.mitigationLabel}</span>
          <span class="font-medium text-ink" id="mitigationText">Maintain holding pressure ≥ 110 bar for continuous aseptic run.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Metrics Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
      <!-- 1. CO2 Phase State -->
      <div class="p-4 bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
          {d.co2PhaseStateLabel}
        </div>
        <div class="text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300 font-mono" id="metricPhaseState">
          Supercritical Fluid
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-1 font-mono" id="metricPhaseSub">
          ρ ≈ 680 kg/m³ • P > Pc, T > Tc
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Dissolved CO2 Concentration -->
      <div class="p-4 bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
          {d.dissolvedCo2Label}
        </div>
        <div class="text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 font-mono" id="metricDissolvedCo2">
          28.4 g/L
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-1 font-mono" id="metricDissolvedCo2Sub">
          kH(T) • f_CO2 Henry's Law
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Cytoplasmic pH Drop -->
      <div class="p-4 bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
          {d.phDropLabel}
        </div>
        <div class="text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-300 font-mono" id="metricPhDrop">
          - 2.45 pH
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-1 font-mono" id="metricPhDropSub">
          Internal pH: 7.20 &rarr; 4.75
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Micro-Bubble Sauter Diameter -->
      <div class="p-4 bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
          {d.bubbleDiameterLabel}
        </div>
        <div class="text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold text-teal-700 dark:text-teal-300 font-mono" id="metricBubbleDiameter">
          18.2 µm
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-1 font-mono" id="metricBubbleSub">
          Interfacial Area a ≈ 3,290 m²/m³
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. Pressurized Residence Time -->
      <div class="p-4 bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
          {d.residenceTimeLabel}
        </div>
        <div class="text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300 font-mono" id="metricResidenceTime">
          168.0 s
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-1 font-mono" id="metricResidenceSub">
          Holding Volume: 28.0 L
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 6. Microbial Lethality (Log) -->
      <div class="p-4 bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
          {d.logReductionLabel}
        </div>
        <div class="text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 font-mono" id="metricLogReduction">
          6.42 Log
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-1 font-mono" id="metricLogSub">
          Survival Fraction: 3.8e-7
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 7. Residual PPO Enzyme Activity -->
      <div class="p-4 bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
          {d.enzymeInactivationLabel}
        </div>
        <div class="text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold text-fuchsia-700 dark:text-fuchsia-300 font-mono" id="metricEnzymeActivity">
          4.2 %
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-1 font-mono" id="metricEnzymeSub">
          95.8% Inactivated (Anti-Browning)
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 8. ASME Vessel Safety Factor -->
      <div class="p-4 bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-xl">
        <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
          {d.asmeSafetyMarginLabel}
        </div>
        <div class="text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold text-sky-800 dark:text-sky-200 font-mono" id="metricAsmeSafety">
          2.68x
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-1 font-mono" id="metricAsmeSub">
          P_burst: 320 bar (ASME VIII Div 1)
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Deep Scientific & Engineering Foundations -->
  <div class="mb-10 border-t border-hairline pt-8">
    <div class="mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>📚</span>
        <span>{d.scienceTitle}</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-muted mt-1">
        {d.scienceSub}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-xs text-body leading-relaxed">
      <div class="p-5 bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-2xl">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-ink mb-2">1. Dense-Phase CO2 Equilibrium &amp; Henry's Law</h3>
        <p class="mb-2">
          At temperatures and pressures exceeding the carbon dioxide vapor-liquid coexistence curve (Pc = 73.8 bar, Tc = 31.1&deg;C), CO2 transitions into a dense-phase liquid or supercritical fluid exhibiting liquid-like densities (&rho; &approx; 600&ndash;900 kg/m&sup3;) and gas-like diffusivities (D &approx; 10&supmin;&sup4; cm&sup2;/s). Dissolution into the aqueous continuous carrier is governed by high-pressure fugacity-corrected Henry's Law:
        </p>
        <div class="p-3 bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-xl font-mono text-[11px] mb-2 text-ink">
          C_CO2 = k_H(T) &bull; &phi;(T, P) &bull; P &bull; exp[(v_CO2^&infin; &bull; (P - P_0)) / (R &bull; T)]
        </div>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">
          Where &phi;(T, P) is the high-pressure fugacity coefficient and v_CO2^&infin; &approx; 32.8 cm&sup3;/mol is the partial molar volume of carbon dioxide at infinite aqueous dilution.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-2xl">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-ink mb-2">2. Venturi Micro-Bubble Shearing &amp; Interfacial Area</h3>
        <p class="mb-2">
          High-pressure Venturi injection nozzles create turbulent micro-orifice shearing (We &gt; 12), fracturing dense CO2 into sub-micro bubbles (d32 = 15&ndash;40 &mu;m). This expands the interfacial gas-liquid specific contact area (a) by over two orders of magnitude compared to traditional static batch autoclaves:
        </p>
        <div class="p-3 bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-xl font-mono text-[11px] mb-2 text-ink">
          a = (6 &bull; &epsilon;_CO2) / d_32 &asymp; 2,500 - 4,500 m&sup2;/m&sup3;
        </div>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">
          Accelerating mass transfer rate dCL/dt = kL &bull; a &bull; (C* - CL), driving rapid fluid saturation in under 3.5 seconds of pipe flow.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-2xl">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-ink mb-2">3. Cytoplasmic Acidification &amp; Cell Lysis Kinetics</h3>
        <p class="mb-2">
          Uncharged, lipophilic dense CO2 rapidly diffuses across microbial phospholipid bilayers. Upon entering the neutral intracellular cytoplasm (pH &approx; 7.0&ndash;7.4), CO2 dissociates into carbonic acid (H2CO3 &hArr; H+ + HCO3-), collapsing internal cellular pH below 4.5. This exhausts proton-translocating ATPases, extracts vital membrane sterols, and triggers explosive structural lysis during rapid cyclone depressurization:
        </p>
        <div class="p-3 bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-xl font-mono text-[11px] mb-2 text-ink">
          Log(N0 / N) = (t / D_eff) = (t / D_ref) &bull; (P / P_ref)^&alpha; &bull; exp[&beta; &bull; (T - T_ref)]
        </div>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">
          Empirical activation exponents (&alpha; = 1.8&ndash;2.4) ensure rapid 5-log inactivation within 45 to 180 seconds at 35&ndash;42&deg;C.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-2xl">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-ink mb-2">4. Aseptic Standards &amp; ASME Pressure Safety</h3>
        <p class="mb-2">
